/GOAL: TO MAP THE FINAL CHARACTER OF AN ESCAPE SEQUENCE
/INTO AN ENTRY IN 'KEYTBL'.  HERE ARE THE POSSIBILITIES:

/	ZBLK 4	UC A-D	UP,DOWN,RIGHT,LEFT
/	ZBLK 2	LC L-M	COMMA,MINUS KEYS (VT100)
/	ZBLK 1	LC N	DECIMAL POINT
/	ZBLK 1	UC M	ENTER KEY
/	ZBLK 12	LC P-Y	NUMERIC KEYS (0-9)
/	ZBLK 3	UC P-R	BLUE, RED, GRAY
/	ZBLK 5	UC S-W	F1-F5 KEYS ON Z-19
/OR	ZBLK 4	UC P-S	PF1-PF4 ON A VT100

IFDEF	VT100 <CLA IAC STL RAL>	/PF1-PF4
IFNDEF	VT100 <CLA IAC>	/BLUE, RED, GRAY + F1-F5
	TAD EM10+1	/UP, DOWN, LEFT, RIGHT
